  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figure 3.4. A layered ArchiMate view for one TPHR sub-goal. 'Establish a secure, universally accessible, verifiable health record for every individual' is realised by the outcome 'Population has verifiable digital health records'; inside 'TPHR Sub-goal #1 Implementation' three capabilities (Health Record Management, Identity & Authentication, Universal Access Enablement) are served by a 'Trusted Personal Health Record (PHR)' product, three application services and three components (Lifelong Health Record, Client Registry, PKI/Trust Infrastructure), which draw on a 'Metadata Components' group of Client, Facility, Health Worker and Product registries and a Terminology Service.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude",
        "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Pc8vSeXCwp5Ckvmz56cMDs"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-15",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Figure 3.4. Une vue ArchiMate en couches pour un sous-objectif TPHR. « Establish a secure, universally accessible, verifiable health record for every individual » est réalisé par le résultat « Population has verifiable digital health records » ; dans « TPHR Sub-goal #1 Implementation », trois capacités (Health Record Management, Identity & Authentication, Universal Access Enablement) sont servies par un produit « Trusted Personal Health Record (PHR) », trois services applicatifs et trois composants (Lifelong Health Record, Client Registry, PKI/Trust Infrastructure), qui s'appuient sur un groupe « Metadata Components » réunissant les registres des clients, des établissements, des agents de santé et des produits, ainsi qu'un Terminology Service.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude",
        "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_013ZJ1uYnvBifNcPaVPVJbUS"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-30",
      "lang": "fr"
    },
    {
      "text": "Figura 3.4. Una vista ArchiMate por capas de un subobjetivo de TPHR. «Establish a secure, universally accessible, verifiable health record for every individual» es realizado por el resultado «Population has verifiable digital health records»; dentro de «TPHR Sub-goal #1 Implementation», tres capacidades (Health Record Management, Identity & Authentication, Universal Access Enablement) son atendidas por un producto «Trusted Personal Health Record (PHR)», tres servicios de aplicación y tres componentes (Lifelong Health Record, Client Registry, PKI/Trust Infrastructure), que se apoyan en un grupo «Metadata Components» con los registros de clientes, establecimientos, trabajadores de la salud y productos, y un Terminology Service.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude",
        "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_013ZJ1uYnvBifNcPaVPVJbUS"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-30",
      "lang": "es"
    },
    {
      "text": "الشكل 3.4. عرض ArchiMate متعدد الطبقات لأحد الأهداف الفرعية لـ TPHR. يتحقق الهدف «Establish a secure, universally accessible, verifiable health record for every individual» عبر النتيجة «Population has verifiable digital health records»؛ وداخل «TPHR Sub-goal #1 Implementation» تخدم ثلاثَ قدرات (Health Record Management وIdentity & Authentication وUniversal Access Enablement) منتجٌ باسم «Trusted Personal Health Record (PHR)» وثلاث خدمات تطبيقات وثلاثة مكوّنات (Lifelong Health Record وClient Registry وPKI/Trust Infrastructure)، تستند إلى مجموعة «Metadata Components» التي تضم سجلات العملاء والمرافق والعاملين الصحيين والمنتجات، وإلى Terminology Service.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude",
        "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_013ZJ1uYnvBifNcPaVPVJbUS"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-30",
      "lang": "ar"
    },
    {
      "text": "Рисунок 3.4. Многоуровневое представление ArchiMate для одной подцели TPHR. «Establish a secure, universally accessible, verifiable health record for every individual» реализуется результатом «Population has verifiable digital health records»; внутри «TPHR Sub-goal #1 Implementation» три возможности (Health Record Management, Identity & Authentication, Universal Access Enablement) обслуживаются продуктом «Trusted Personal Health Record (PHR)», тремя прикладными сервисами и тремя компонентами (Lifelong Health Record, Client Registry, PKI/Trust Infrastructure), которые опираются на группу «Metadata Components» из реестров клиентов, учреждений, медицинских работников и продукции, а также на Terminology Service.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude",
        "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_013ZJ1uYnvBifNcPaVPVJbUS"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-30",
      "lang": "ru"
    },
    {
      "text": "图 3.4。某一 TPHR 子目标的分层 ArchiMate 视图。“Establish a secure, universally accessible, verifiable health record for every individual”由成果“Population has verifiable digital health records”实现；在“TPHR Sub-goal #1 Implementation”内，三项能力（Health Record Management、Identity & Authentication、Universal Access Enablement）由一个“Trusted Personal Health Record (PHR)”产品、三项应用服务和三个组件（Lifelong Health Record、Client Registry、PKI/Trust Infrastructure）提供服务，这些组件依托一个“Metadata Components”分组（包括服务对象、机构、卫生工作者和产品登记库）以及一个 Terminology Service。",
      "state": "draft",
